{"authority":{"artifact":"CANDIDATE_IDENTITY_ONLY","data":"NONE","evidence":"DECLARED_LOCATORS_ONLY_NOT_VERIFIED","execution":"NONE","formation":"NONE","qualification":"NONE","results":"NONE"},"evaluation":{"holdout":"Only a later, separately authorized 2023 Formation may evaluate the five frozen proposals. The 2024 one-way holdout remains unread; any pre-admission read or result-dependent change invalidates this proposal.","metrics":[{"id":"metric-1","statement":"Predeclared reject-only diagnostics are per-leg and combined net return after fixed costs, maximum drawdown, turnover, exposure, repair incidence, and unresolved-state count; none is Alpha or qualification evidence."},{"id":"metric-2","statement":"The primary is coordinate 0, lookback 60 with both features. Coordinates 3 and 4 are nonselectable 30-day and 90-day sensitivities; no sensitivity may replace the primary after observing results."},{"id":"metric-3","statement":"A later budget is NOT_GRANTED until future frozen consumable D1 revision count D and source scope are bound: max_total_effects=max_submits=2D+2; max_opening_submits=2*ceil(D/2); opening quantity caps are 0.01*ceil(D/2) BTC and 0.1*ceil(D/2) ETH."}]},"evidence":[{"claim":"Time-series momentum is a declared design precedent; transfer to BTC and ETH independent long-flat daily signals is unverified and this locator is not evidence of profitability here.","id":"source-1-time-series-momentum","locator":"https://w4.stern.nyu.edu/facdir/lpederse/papers/TimeSeriesMomentum.pdf"},{"claim":"Cryptocurrency return and risk evidence is a declared market-context locator only; it does not prove this momentum method, BTC/ETH transfer, implementation, or profitability.","id":"source-2-crypto-context","locator":"https://academic.oup.com/rfs/article-abstract/34/6/2689/5912024"},{"claim":"White's Reality Check motivates a reject-only data-snooping and multiple-model policy; this proposal claims no method equivalence, implementation, verified result, or BTC/ETH transfer from the locator.","id":"source-3-reality-check","locator":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1111/1468-0262.00152"}],"falsifiers":["Any callback permutation changes the ordered action sequence, terminal state, or fault outcome for identical paired D1 and H1 facts.","Any coordinate, feature, lookback, persistence rule, quantity, metric, or evaluation interval is selected or changed after observing a result.","Any order anomaly cannot be flattened by the one bounded global draining batch or leaves pending or positive residual quantity at the final observation.","BTC actions change solely because valid ETH close values change, or the without-ETH proposal emits any ETH action.","The primary 60-day full-feature proposal fails a predeclared 2023 rejection limit; 30-day or 90-day sensitivity performance cannot rescue it.","The sealed 2024 one-way holdout is read before separate admission and independently reproducible evaluation."],"hypothesis":"On later-authorized, point-in-time 2023 retrospective inputs, independently positive BTC and ETH close-to-close absolute momentum over a frozen daily lookback, optionally requiring two consecutive positive signals, may support falsifiable fixed-size long-flat behavior; transfer from the cited literature is unverified and this proposal asserts no Alpha, result, qualification, capacity, risk-parity, live, or execution authority.","identity":"btc-eth-dual-long-flat-absolute-momentum-v1","inputs":{"channels":[{"id":"channel-1-btc-d1","statement":"Completed BTC D1 bars are bound to signal channel 1; paired continuity and availability are validated before a signal can exist."},{"id":"channel-2-eth-d1","statement":"Completed ETH D1 bars are bound to signal channel 2; ETH values never enter the BTC momentum calculation."},{"id":"channel-3-btc-h1","statement":"Completed BTC H1 bars are bound to execution channel 3 and executable handle 1."},{"id":"channel-4-eth-h1","statement":"Completed ETH H1 bars are bound to execution channel 4 and executable handle 2."},{"id":"channel-5-snapshots","statement":"Every bar callback carries both executable position and pending-order facts; only a complete paired H1 snapshot strictly later than signal availability may consume a signal."}]},"kind":"ResearchIntentProposal","non_claims":["NO_ALPHA_CLAIM","NO_DATA_AUTHORITY","NO_EVIDENCE_VERIFICATION","NO_EXECUTION_AUTHORITY","NO_FORMATION_AUTHORITY","NO_LIVE_AUTHORITY","NO_QUALIFICATION_AUTHORITY","NO_RESULT_AUTHORITY"],"parameter_space":{"parameters":[{"id":"parameter-1-coordinates","statement":"Exactly five stable proposals exist: 0=(60,full features 3), 1=(60,without ETH feature 2), 2=(60,without persistence feature 1), 3=(30,full features 3), and 4=(90,full features 3); no other combination is admitted."},{"id":"parameter-2-signal","statement":"For each enabled leg m=close[t]/close[t-L]-1 without a logarithm. Full requires current and previous momentum above zero; no-persistence requires current above zero; nonpositive momentum exits and resets persistence."},{"id":"parameter-3-sizing","statement":"BTC quantity is fixed at 0.01 and ETH quantity at 0.1. These are proposal assumptions, not risk parity, volatility scaling, capacity evidence, or a granted effect budget."},{"id":"parameter-4-selection","statement":"Coordinate 0 is the sole primary; coordinates 3 and 4 are nonselectable sensitivities, and coordinates 1 and 2 are fixed feature deletions. No pair search, coordinate expansion, result fitting, or holdout-driven replacement is admitted."}]},"revision":1,"schema_version":1}
